    "snippet": "- Dry weather with zero rain chances will persist through Saturday with shower and storm chances returning to AZ as early as Sunday. While the shortwave may lead to isolated showers and storms up along the Mogollon Rim Wednesday, the lower deserts are expected to remain dry.",
